            ("You", "もちろんです。スマホでもきれいに撮れるコツがあるんですよ。", "Mochiron desu. Sumaho demo kirei ni toreru kotsu ga arun desu yo.", "Of course. There are tricks for great shots even on a phone."),
            ("Kenta", "楽しみです。いつがいいですか。", "Tanoshimi desu. Itsu ga ii desu ka.", "I'm looking forward to it. When works for you?"),
